 you could be next! Govern yourselves accordingly! https://t.co/0qQdLEgnAe https://t.co/J37IOmV1Im"},{"attachments":{"media_keys":["13_1894780434128490496"]},"author_id":"88784440","created_at":"2025-02-26T16:07:24.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["1894781205461037260","1894781319000846482"],"id":"1894781319000846482","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":89,"impression_count":545404,"like_count":7076,"quote_count":41,"reply_count":126,"retweet_count":1173},"text":"Harmeet Dhillon’s career reflects conviction and the relentless, unapologetic pursuit of justice. https://t.co/VcPDvCOwo2"},{"attachments":{"media_keys":["3_1866271029305430016"]},"author_id":"201066140","created_at":"2024-12-10T00:15:08.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["1866275419173073208"],"entities":{"mentions":[{"end":243,"id":"93755660","start":234,"username":"PamBondi"}]},"id":"1866275419173073208","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":772,"impression_count":3089698,"like_count":73136,"quote_count":1314,"reply_count":9614,"retweet_count":12434},"text":"I'm extremely honored by President Trump's nomination to assist with our nation's civil rights agenda. It has been my dream to be able to serve our great country, and I am so excited to be part of an incredible team of lawyers led by @PamBondi. I cannot wait to get to work!  \n\nI https://t.co/L2NCA9m987"}],"users":[{"id":"1551266822460162051","name":"Mike Lee","username":"BasedMikeLee"},{"id":"201066140","name":"Harmeet K. Dhillon","username":"HarmeetKDhillon"},{"id":"1911884791911231489","name":"AAGHarmeetDhillon","username":"AAGDhillon"},{"id":"1612483604071727104","name":"Rep. Mark Alford","username":"RepMarkAlford"}]},"meta":{"newest_id":"2118419914793042196","next_token":"b26v89c19zqg8o3frr3tei7o9gdyiqrvrni6ke9sq2mbh","oldest_id":"1866497126005670118","result_count":11}},"est_left":220},{"qid":"K60.O3:b","result":{"meta":{"result_count":0}},"est_left":219},{"qid":"K60.O4:a","result":{"meta":{"result_count":0}},"est_left":218},{"qid":"K60.O4:b","result"